---

## Interpreted Intent

Build a full-stack HRIS system frontend with:
- Dashboard with chart shortcuts
- Leave Quota (Jatah Cuti), Attendance Permission (Izin Hadir), Business Trip (Perjalanan Dinas) features
- Top navigation with Dashboard and Personal Management
- Personal Management page with employee data and sidebar
- Fully responsive design
- Bun runtime + Prisma + PostgreSQL backend

